{{Quote|The belters are mining the asteroid fields at the edge of the system|High Magistrate Greef Karga to Din Djarin|<ref name="Chapter 17" />}}
The [[planet]] [[Nevarro]] was located in the '''Nevarro system''' of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. At the edge of the system, there were [[Nevarro system asteroid fields|asteroid fields]] that were mined by [[Belters]]. Nevarro became an independent trade anchor near the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="Chapter 17" />

